description	"Red Eclipse Slaver

A slaver intent on capturing their enemy in traps, by grappling them or other special gear. They will take you alive.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 15%+ Movement Speed
- Red Eclipse Sonic Rifle
-- DC Carbine 2, 45%- Damage/15%+ RoF/45%- Velocity
-- Low Clipsize/Sonic Shots/Mag Reload/Cripples
- Capture Tripmines (2)
-- Shocks/Cripples/Stuns/Tracks
-- Low Damage
- Shock-Pulse Stun Baton
-- 2 Hit Combo
-- Red Style
-- Disarms/Cripples/Pulses/Stuns
-- Fast Movement
- Super-Heated Projectile Rifle
-- 80%- Damage/100%+ Velocity
-- Cripples/Pulses/Mag Reload/Ignites/Knocksback/Stuns/Cripples
-- Slow Movement Speed

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcements (2)
- Cortosis Lined Armor (1)
- 200%+ Skill Cooldown
- Dexterity (1)

^8Abilities:
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]
- Dexterity Roll ^3[CS2]
- Gunkick ^3[CS3]
- Zap Cord (Grapplehook 2) ^3[CS4]
-- Pulses/Stuns/Cripple/Blinds"